{"slug":"tim-ryan-ohio-politician","qid":"Q513960","name":"Tim Ryan","desc":"American politician (born 1973)","article":"Tim Ryan (Ohio politician)","born":"1973-07-16","died":null,"birthplace":"Niles","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"OH-13","f":2013,"u":2023},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"OH-17","f":2003,"u":2013},{"t":"State Senate of Ohio","w":"","f":2000,"u":2002}],"summary":"Timothy John Ryan (born July 16, 1973) is an American politician who represented Ohio in the United States House of Representatives from 2003 to 2023. A member of the Democratic Party, he represented Ohio's 13th congressional district from 2013 to 2023, having previously represented Ohio's 17th congressional district from 2003 to 2013. Ryan's district encompassed a large swath of northeastern Ohio, including Youngstown and parts of Akron.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2022,"o":"S","k":"OH","p":"D","v":1939489,"s":46.92,"w":false,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":173631,"s":52.49,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":153323,"s":60.99,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":208610,"s":67.73,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":120230,"s":68.49,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":235492,"s":72.77,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"OH-17","p":"D","v":102758,"s":53.89,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"OH-17","p":"D","v":218896,"s":78.15,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"OH-17","p":"D","v":170369,"s":80.25,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"OH-17","p":"D","v":212800,"s":77.19,"w":true,"n":"Tim Ryan"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"OH-17","p":"D","v":94441,"s":51.14,"w":true,"n":"Timothy J Ryan"}]}